{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"verifyLogoutToken","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"token","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configuration","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OidcConfiguration","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OidcConfiguration"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VerifiedLogoutToken","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK19VerifiedLogoutTokenV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the half that carries security weight: the input arrives unsolicited, from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"network, and instructs the RP to terminate a session. Every check below is required, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each exists because skipping it has a name:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Signature against the OP’s JWKS, through the same §12.4 verifier — no second"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key-fetching path."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"iss","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" matches the discovery issuer; ","type":"text"},{"code":"aud","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" contains this client’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"client_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A token","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"minted for another RP is not accepted here.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"events","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" contains the back-channel logout key with an object value. This is what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinguishes a logout token from an ID token; skipping it accepts a replayed ID token"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a logout instruction."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nonce"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"absent"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Back-Channel Logout 1.0 §2.4 forbids it, and its presence is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the documented signature of an ID token being replayed — rejected, not ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"At least one of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sid"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sub"},{"text":" is present. A token naming neither identifies nothing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"exp"},{"type":"text","text":" is in the future and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"iat"},{"type":"text","text":" recent."}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken\/sid","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is present, end that session only.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Falling back to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“every session for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sub"},{"type":"text","text":"” when a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sid"},{"type":"text","text":" was supplied is the same over-reach the server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses to make."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken\/jwtID","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is surfaced so the caller can deduplicate; this SDK does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not dedup internally (§12.7.3 rule 7) — delivery is at-least-once, and a library with no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"durable store would silently drop a real second logout after a restart.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/verifyLogoutToken(_:configuration:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC17verifyLogoutToken_13configurationAA08VerifiedeF0VSS_AA17OidcConfigurationVtYaKF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"verifyLogoutToken(_:configuration:)","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"verifyLogoutToken"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"configuration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV","text":"OidcConfiguration"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK19VerifiedLogoutTokenV","text":"VerifiedLogoutToken"}],"role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK